  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム』より、ザクIIがHGシリーズに登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", Zaku II appears in the HG series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部のアーマーは素材の異なる２種類から選択式。軟質素材はアニメの動きを彷彿とさせる脚部の可動を再現。",
      "en": "• The waist armor can be selected from two different materials. The soft material reproduces the movement of the legs, which is reminiscent of the movements in the anime."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 本体各所は機体フォルムに合わせた可動ギミックを採用。",
      "en": "• Each part of the main body uses movable gimmicks that match the form of the aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ザクIIが装備する代表的な武装が付属。",
      "en": "• Includes typical weapons equipped by Zaku II."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ランドセルはザクIIの設定に合わせた造形になっている。",
      "en": "• The school bag is shaped to match the Zaku II settings."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
